      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、当然よ。次のお仕事に向けて\r\nコンディションも万全に整えてあるわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまない\r\n少しここで待っててくれるか？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0103"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいわ。気にしないで",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう『――はい、いつもお世話になっております――",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0106"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉\r\n取材の件だが……ん？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "どうしたの？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、今さっきの……\r\n何をしてたのかなって思って",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "片足立ちよ\r\n手軽にどこでもできる、いいトレーニング法なの",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いつもそうやって、\r\n短い時間にもトレーニングをしてるのか？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "もちろんよ。はじめに言ったでしょう\r\n私はトップアイドルを目指しているって",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そのためには、いつも貪欲に\r\n自分を鍛え続けないといけないの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "たとえどんなに短くても\r\n空いた時間を無駄になんてできないわ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "select": "夏葉のトップに対する\r\n気持ちはすごいな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "select": "頑張るのも大切だけど、\r\n無理をしないようにな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "他にはどんな\r\n筋トレがあるんだ？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020090,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "当然よ\r\nいい？　トップというものは本当にすごいのよ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "たくさんの人たちの中の１番……\r\nたった１人だけが勝ち取る頂点……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それは誰よりも努力をしたという証拠よ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "中途半端な気持ちなんかじゃ、\r\n絶対に辿り着くことはできないの",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だからこのぐらいのことは当たり前だわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでもすごいものはすごいじゃないか\r\nどうしてそんなに自分に厳しくなれるんだ？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……私は大きなことを\r\n成し遂げる人間になりたいの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "誰よりも頑張ってアイドルのトップになることで、\r\n私はそんな未来の私に近づける気がしているのよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（熱いな……夏葉のこの気持ちがきっと報われるように\r\n俺も気合いを入れてサポートしていこう）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大切なことは、\r\nなにもトレーニングだけじゃないだろ？"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あら、大丈夫よ\r\n全てにおいて努力しているわ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはそれで心配なんだが……",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいかしら？　私が目指しているのは\r\nただのアイドルじゃない、トップアイドルよ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そこを目指すからには\r\nただの努力なんかじゃ足りないの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはわかるが、\r\n没頭しすぎるのはよくない",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "心配性ね\r\nこのくらい本当に大したことはないのよ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "正直、トップを目指すためには\r\nまだまだ足りないくらいだもの",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だから私は、もっともっと頑張るつもりよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……ひた向きだな。無茶をしすぎないかだけは心配だが\r\nそこは俺がしっかり見守っていこう）",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020220,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "隙間時間を使って電車の移動中につま先立ちをするとか、\r\n立ったまま、かかとを上げ下げするのもいいし……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それに普段の姿勢をぴんと美しく保つことを\r\n心がけるだけでも筋肉の付き方は変わってくるのよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……と、ひとまずこんなところにしておくけど\r\nこれでわかったかしら？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど。すごく考えられてるんだな",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020250,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "たとえ隙間時間と言っても\r\nトレーニングの可能性は無限なのよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごいな\r\nまるでトレーニング博士だ",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020260,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ふふっ、プロデューサーもやってみるといいわ\r\nアイドルじゃなくても、筋肉があって困ることはないもの",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、俺もさっきの片足立ちをやってみるよ――\r\n……っとと、と、うおっ？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013001020270,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、全然ダメね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300102/1013001020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……さっきの夏葉、すごく簡単そうにしていたよな\r\nそれだけいつも頑張ってるということか）",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、その努力がちゃんと実るように\r\n俺も全力で支えていこう）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]